{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:03.499018+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 179.9s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('bbe462f597ae4b4f833086f499fd5f51', 'd89bb93f10a44168bf23c7d12a827fe8', 4491946, 1, 'Pilot', 'Captain Sonny Jennings and his core team of lifeguards monitor the dangerous Hawaiian waters; new lifeguard recruits compete to join Sonny’s district; Sonny and his family grieve after the loss of his nephew; Em reveals a romantic past with Will.', '2024-09-22', 44, 6.667, 3, '/76BiFQo7iE9rSltfvOtk3Q08TPZ.jpg', None, '1a45cd76287a4b09ac3c024258605a1a', 'd89bb93f10a44168bf23c7d12a827fe8', 5281223, 2, 'Mauka to Makai', 'A flash flood sweeps a young tourist away from her family and out to deep sea; going against Sonny’s wishes, Em takes a bold risk and places her own life in danger in hopes of rescuing the lost -at-sea tourist.', '2024-09-23', 44, 6.667, 3, '/oV6CS5S2EiEvl5FGvPJhBf5WA6M.jpg', None, 'f75024cb88d54f3586f589a69fbba5e4', 'd89bb93f10a44168bf23c7d12a827fe8', 5281224, 3, 'The Deep End', \"Em works to earn the team's respect when she is left in charge and Hina and Kainalu juggle multiple beachside emergencies; Will's fiancee pays him a visit at work; Sonny opens up to a former lifeguard about his trauma since losing his nephew.\", '2024-09-30', 44, 6.333, 3, '/1vXqdSojSZQbzPf3uOvra7E4pn2.jpg', None, '962ec1f6136949989c916c2f5cb8ed59', 'd89bb93f10a44168bf23c7d12a827fe8', 5642914, 4, 'Kick Out', 'College kids get trapped in a collapsed sandpit; Sonny, Will and Laka race to rescue people stranded after a shark attack; Will learns if he made the cut for the firefighter job he has been pursuing.', '2024-10-07', 44, 5.667, 3, '/6qjWtUxJydC24YIesoUYJCLnxaK.jpg', None, '5677f2f2cf734328a576c3af43302d33', 'd89bb93f10a44168bf23c7d12a827fe8' ... 128 parameters truncated ... '/99nIJqrfgyMCcOK8DRWTZC0NtL3.jpg', None, '61559e8973f34fb5b3719615e2aecb47', 'd89bb93f10a44168bf23c7d12a827fe8', 5946284, 16, 'Pono', 'Em takes the day off to spend time with her mom, but races into action when she comes across an unresponsive cave diver; Will confides in Vince about his personal anger issues; Laka searches for a missing local.', '2025-03-03', 43, 5.5, 2, '/mhmcRr5QGpL9Hx0PPsSL5m8XGqz.jpg', None, '9b322b5b57ad430ca905163f718226ed', 'd89bb93f10a44168bf23c7d12a827fe8', 5946285, 17, 'Sea Change', \"Will and Em race to rescue a windsurfer that wipes out and suffers cardiac arrest; Capt. Sonny reunites with Ocean over a family lunch and Em realizes her mom is back to her old ways; Hina tries to hide her jealousy over Kainalu's new relationship.\", '2025-03-10', 44, 5.5, 2, '/65uYHXDOhlkAfOKpopwx7tcLGXh.jpg', None, '6718cd643e6f45f3b823622699fc63ca', 'd89bb93f10a44168bf23c7d12a827fe8', 5946287, 18, 'Flowback', 'While monitoring the beach, Laka and Will notice a toxic smell coming from a van and discover a kid unconscious and surrounded by drug paraphernalia; Em befriends a disabled veteran; Hina finally confesses her feelings to Kainalu.', '2025-03-24', 44, 5.5, 2, '/pj2TkPO0lPxsl80ENkowKJhIcAt.jpg', None, '345ad1fcb93940e5a79fea2d094e7a40', 'd89bb93f10a44168bf23c7d12a827fe8', 5946288, 19, 'Let Go', \"Hina and Kainalu assist the US Coast Guard in searching for two missing snorkelers left behind in the middle of the Ocean. Meanwhile, Captain Sonny t ... (30 characters truncated) ... s about Vince. Will and Julie meet for coffee and Em receives a job offer from a very rich person. Laka and the team attend Ocean's graduation party.\", '2025-03-31', 43, 5.5, 2, '/gwbbb47zBEtZo6FXA2BO9h731Bz.jpg', None)"}
