{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:03.824222+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 180.2s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('566d81a286a04a5d863bbcbc0b1d47ce', 'b56486141a0d447caab35ea2d1a315c2', 3098321, 1, 'Remembrance Video Commentary', 'Executive producers Alex Kurtzman, Akiva Goldsman, and Michael Chabon, supervising producer Kirsten Beyer, and director Hanelle M. Culpepper provide commentary about episode one of Star Trek: Picard.', '2020-10-06', 44, 0.0, 0, '/6bBkobS79OzMCJZKPWLkYYIfa6K.jpg', None, '4fc652688e094e839eaaa4f5fd6177ab', 'b56486141a0d447caab35ea2d1a315c2', 3098323, 2, 'Make It So', 'The co-creators and Patrick Stewart discuss bringing the iconic character back to the screen, including what was compelling enough to warrant it and the obstacles they had to overcome to make it so.', '2020-10-06', 10, 0.0, 0, '/aaFq2AgzulgukC8ouKkd7YACL1n.jpg', None, '2a6aa71289e14f3f94a1720d68c38982', 'b56486141a0d447caab35ea2d1a315c2', 3098324, 3, 'Story Log: Remembrance', 'Behind-the-scenes footage of Hanelle Culpepper directing the series premiere of ‘Picard,’ a character that she says she has loved “as much as any Trekkie out there,” so she “definitely felt that pressure.”', '2020-10-06', 4, 0.0, 0, '/1JQAQZMEPWwRSXl5FlxSOjBUc10.jpg', None, '7bd2bbc6a0dd4dc083d89c21af56bd68', 'b56486141a0d447caab35ea2d1a315c2', 3098325, 4, 'Story Log: Maps and Legends', 'Interviews with Michael Chabon, Eugene Roddenberry, Trevor Roth and Heather Kadin, including discussion of actor Harry Treadwell and the ambiguity he brought to the role of Narek.', '2020-10-06', 8, 0.0, 0, '/qblHyxDrrTJrNdOtkkFV2BS603R.jpg', None, 'd3ba14f2f7204546bb4878ae2ff8b30e', 'b56486141a0d447caab35ea2d1a315c2' ... 428 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'ff22b1b5d48840c8bbc876411c1bc7e3', 'b56486141a0d447caab35ea2d1a315c2', 5427125, 42, \"'Remembrance' Deleted Scene\", None, '2020-10-06', 3, 0.0, 0, None, None, '5b3c8a4b2efa4c699958dc3896704be2', 'b56