{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:04.899869+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 181.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('a9e3789b643245279936943d4e88c520', '51570f4a70c3421d8c4dd3b3acf48d5a', 1204387, 1, 'Pilot', 'Lower-level cabinet member Tom Kirkman becomes President of the United States after a catastrophic attack on the U.S. Capitol. Kirkman must keep the country and his family safe while leading the search for the those responsible for the attack.', '2016-09-21', 44, 7.6, 50, '/qaYfFcIqlzlqqRw5MN16nMb3MPF.jpg', None, 'f3b435efc62a41088e17b89a9b89887e', '51570f4a70c3421d8c4dd3b3acf48d5a', 1223502, 2, 'The First Day', 'Hours after the attack on the Capitol, President Kirkman steps into his role as Commander-in-Chief in the midst of chaos and confusion. Facing dangerous new challenges and adversaries, Kirkman struggles to hold a country together that is on the brink of falling apart.', '2016-09-28', 45, 7.0, 31, '/p12fc59MiwrIomlW9pMpVUbCtYr.jpg', None, '23aa0ce3fa0b40159e0bbcb0d4732456', '51570f4a70c3421d8c4dd3b3acf48d5a', 1223503, 3, 'The Confession', 'President Kirkman and his staff work to keep a high-level security breach of the White House a secret just as he’s about to give his first television ... (13 characters truncated) ... he FBI continues to investigate the Capitol bombing but Agent Hannah Wells starts to develop her own theories about who was really behind the attack.', '2016-10-05', 44, 7.1, 29, '/bE0hpviTLAYlF7JLhlo7ZlcgMqs.jpg', None, '9bf5846629814759896375fd866e99ab', '51570f4a70c3421d8c4dd3b3acf48d5a', 1229431, 4, 'The Enemy', 'Kirkman learns who is behind the attack and needs to grapple not only with the prospect of war, but brewing domestic troubles as well. Kirkman taps Emily to monitor the domestic situation. Alex may be in for more than she bargains for when she seeks out help from Hookstraten.', '2016-10-12', 44, 7.7, 24, '/y205klNZ1DNdZWcUp1wUZ1oMpQe.jpg', None, 'b58d1ac054634a42b5594944af45af9a', '51570f4a70c3421d8c4dd3b3acf48d5a' ... 152 parameters truncated ... '/vmUTbH0w9Y0d4g77yPDpiMCGvpQ.jpg', None, '45cfa8ff768941148778696ba6276d40', '51570f4a70c3421d8c4dd3b3acf48d5a', 1303109, 18, 'Lazarus', \"As President Kirkman considers candidates for Vice President, Kimble Hookstraten finds herself embroiled in scandal. Agent Wells and Jason Atwood return from North Dakota with a critical new lead while journalist Abe Leonard's investigation takes an unexpected turn.\", '2017-04-26', 43, 7.1, 18, '/xhG6cHIJR8iLB6Nf6rv9hZdNzr7.jpg', None, '3c10a891c49b44efa8d7470598129703', '51570f4a70c3421d8c4dd3b3acf48d5a', 1308320, 19, 'Misalliance', 'As the White House gears up for President Kirkman’s first international summit, Kimble Hookstraten faces her toughest political battle yet when her speakership is challenged. Meanwhile, Alex wrestles with whether or not to bring the kids back to Washington.', '2017-05-03', 42, 7.0, 17, '/dQc6BTdyOEqOZiApcFYcHQ6KEJg.jpg', None, '8a2e096efa444c409e873278b8d423f6', '51570f4a70c3421d8c4dd3b3acf48d5a', 1308319, 20, 'Bombshell', 'President Kirkman’s first international summit is derailed when journalist Abe Leonard publishes an explosive article. Meanwhile, Hannah Wells uncovers the conspiracy’s next target.', '2017-05-10', 42, 7.2, 17, '/fRU444JgNhHPl1cOlnw5VLIyCVA.jpg', None, '5030c03d65894c539c424ce931ec6b1f', '51570f4a70c3421d8c4dd3b3acf48d5a', 1308317, 21, 'Brace for Impact', 'In the nail-biting season finale, Hannah Wells must stop the conspiracy from carrying out a final attack while President Kirkman authorizes a nationwide manhunt for the mastermind behind it all.', '2017-05-17', 42, 6.9, 19, '/dnSd39madc4aZeo4p1rGQDgh1MO.jpg', None)"}
