{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:05.047086+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 181.4s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('e63d0961bbfc40278b10c9a0ceb48af2', 'b22ffa2873614cfa884c02ee606223ac', 1345732, 1, 'One Year In', 'Now, one year into office, Kirkman is a Commander-in-Chief determined to rebuild the Capitol and capture the terrorists behind the catastrophic attac ... (31 characters truncated) ... rainian nationalists hijack a Russian Air flight, the president is faced with a hostage situation in which his diplomatic skills are put to the test.', '2017-09-27', 42, 6.5, 21, '/by23X7AzEoRn2zYK7xX1AWZGfeN.jpg', None, '5ad06953510c447ca13385f1bf0343b9', 'b22ffa2873614cfa884c02ee606223ac', 1345734, 2, 'Sting of the Tail', 'FBI Agent Hannah Wells finally closes in on Patrick Lloyd, but when the president decides to take action during the White House Correspondents Dinner, members of the Homeland Security Council threaten to derail their plans.', '2017-10-04', 42, 6.8, 16, '/et4JapXznGtwAF1L6sg6NY1fOlk.jpg', None, '57f45738a1da4b90af9362ff9f4458c9', 'b22ffa2873614cfa884c02ee606223ac', 1371353, 3, 'Outbreak', 'President Kirkman is faced with a viral pandemic that threatens to kill countless Americans. Hannah and Damian discover evidence that could change the lives of members of the first family forever.', '2017-10-11', 43, 6.8, 15, '/xfcWlj7JJMaQKQRaTNAfqbgd9Jj.jpg', None, '4817a19e8f5447778e0459dfdf9c1d31', 'b22ffa2873614cfa884c02ee606223ac', 1374287, 4, 'Equilibrium', 'Tensions rise between America and Mexico when a Mexican citizen is shot during a border dispute regarding Mexican trade imports. Kirkman and his staff must work quickly to resolve the situation and create a new trade deal.', '2017-10-18', 41, 6.6, 15, '/7FVn6QqpCSbyICzWDYfe1PTJk2W.jpg', None, '870156809d0247d4a41a6560a84cf0de', 'b22ffa2873614cfa884c02ee606223ac' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/g7igDC1qGmQe7CuaEkDCZ2BncFV.jpg', None, 'e69766d1fb57462fa327709d1b58df42', 'b22ffa2873614cfa884c02ee606223ac', 1472576, 19, 'Capacity', \"Attorney Ethan West calls on President Kirkman's closest advisors and staff as he begins his investigation.\", '2018-04-25', 44, 6.2, 8, '/7nAtpXRQxPt0DAsvhidtXIly4MQ.jpg', None, '04a8b466484941b2ad7cf664745a63fa', 'b22ffa2873614cfa884c02ee606223ac', 1472577, 20, 'Bad Reception', 'President Kirkman negotiates with a foreign government to release an American held overseas, while attorney Ethan West continues his investigation.', '2018-05-02', 43, 6.0, 7, '/3rvhzxaDoDSqp5HOsc5RI6yJ7cq.jpg', None, 'c0ad47a677fe4e63b6b78afd37064aba', 'b22ffa2873614cfa884c02ee606223ac', 1472578, 21, 'Target', \"White House Council Kendra Daynes finds herself in a dangerous situation that puts another White House staffer's life at risk, while Hannah Wells takes an unexpected trip for answers.\", '2018-05-09', 43, 5.9, 7, '/sS8NYiUkci71uQJnpg84GL2bkpG.jpg', None, '51f577a05d4940828bd0e106dbd49145', 'b22ffa2873614cfa884c02ee606223ac', 1472579, 22, 'Run', 'As President Kirkman continues to deal with the turmoil surrounding the hacker and Congressional investigation, a natural disaster threatens the lives of two White House staffers. Meanwhile, Kirkman’s closest allies are surprised when the president makes an announcement no one saw coming.', '2018-05-16', 43, 5.4, 8, '/8xB2pjXxsikYxGevBGnNlz3T84F.jpg', None)"}
