{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:05.185630+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 181.6s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('cca85df0eace48e39d6ce740a9794465', 'e20fc3e69a7a4bde9a7137af3df7afce', 1769152, 1, '#thesystemisbroken', 'Now running for office for the first time, Kirkman and his nascent campaign stumble out of the gate. Wells gets a critical reassignment.', '2019-06-07', 50, 5.2, 16, '/vPNRBmQaQeTij6Y86eRiXetruRZ.jpg', None, 'dcabeffe59b841f5a1d4625a86bb3ee7', 'e20fc3e69a7a4bde9a7137af3df7afce', 1809424, 2, '#slipperyslope', \"A heated debate over child marriage roils Kirkman's staff. Opioid addiction hits home for Mars. A biohacker turns Wells onto a chilling new threat.\", '2019-06-07', 49, 5.7, 13, '/k1AI9t3UXEoULi3lpCkDGSMwPqv.jpg', None, '9edc937f41ab4edb9ecf40abf6560d5a', 'e20fc3e69a7a4bde9a7137af3df7afce', 1809425, 3, '#privacyplease', 'A political attack on Kirkman puts privacy and transgender rights in the spotlight. Aaron weighs a major decision. Wells and Eli track a bioterrorist.', '2019-06-07', 46, 5.9, 10, '/qlnDWbPPjrGfyWjE9TYd4ZcdJnA.jpg', None, '54fb78cad663468eb95a1cc08285c382', 'e20fc3e69a7a4bde9a7137af3df7afce', 1809426, 4, '#makehistory', \"Aaron's heritage and a widespread teachers' strike become polarizing issues, and Wells discovers a sinister pattern in a flu outbreak.\", '2019-06-07', 50, 4.9, 9, '/ccBrybQx1AyKZNcM8uGxzI4vHpD.jpg', None, '71c7d5fb17e4455aa5f8347ac3b04ae8', 'e20fc3e69a7a4bde9a7137af3df7afce' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/o18KD6roQFPctZv1RitB1e993Io.jpg', None, '630e4de590a441d8a20347cbd4b83350', 'e20fc3e69a7a4bde9a7137af3df7afce', 1809429, 7, '#identity/crisis', \"A stray Russian bomber jeopardizes Seattle, Mars crusades against a drug company, and an event from Aaron's childhood vexes Kirkman's campaign.\", '2019-06-07', 52, 5.0, 10, '/saXkjiDiJBNEW1PedvmDQookAQ4.jpg', None, '0e87e01ee4674a7bbcc7e907ba34c4c6', 'e20fc3e69a7a4bde9a7137af3df7afce', 1809430, 8, '#scaredsh*tless', 'Kirkman mobilizes a frantic hunt for the bioterrorist. Lorraine plays hardball and pushes the opioid epidemic into the campaign fray.', '2019-06-07', 51, 5.0, 8, '/94OqmfNnmnYxo4kDgOYV4CQ539W.jpg', None, 'e294e95a92514729948747302930d402', 'e20fc3e69a7a4bde9a7137af3df7afce', 1809431, 9, '#undecided', \"Trailing in the polls, Kirkman weighs forcing the FBI's hand over the bioterrorism plot. Emily struggles with her mother's final wishes.\", '2019-06-07', 47, 5.1, 8, '/l0hRcK0y54R8XtYz6IQJAL8nst6.jpg', None, '6f1ab97dfe844dcdb80e0af0e6ec8319', 'e20fc3e69a7a4bde9a7137af3df7afce', 1809432, 10, '#truthorconsequences', 'On election day, Kirkman turns to his therapist to assuage his conscience about the events -- and his own decisions -- of the momentous prior 36 hours.', '2019-06-07', 53, 4.7, 9, '/cpy3uV100RyZuvJN535JLTrj4Nz.jpg', None)"}
