{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:05.887007+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 182.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('51b95ddf87a54e818e0185142aa3fe92', '0c9d0b3f000b40a7973420c55c3bdde0', 5477829, 1, 'Episode 1', \"London's Major Trauma System springs into action when a fairground ride malfunction in Brockwell Park results in multiple critically injured patients.\", '2025-07-23', 42, 7.0, 2, '/tQZH8tC9jw1ktaQdLstmn2b78AH.jpg', None, 'a1e0aa152fe04bf88e77dc14344ac8b7', '0c9d0b3f000b40a7973420c55c3bdde0', 6374449, 2, 'Episode 2', 'A life-threatening head injury from an assault and an open leg fracture from a motorcycle accident both require urgent surgery to prevent the worst.', '2025-07-23', 47, 7.0, 2, '/pyEy8JwqXbUKBGxuDlt6P4zGVfS.jpg', None, 'ee507f58e39d4237942be3c6cc7960fa', '0c9d0b3f000b40a7973420c55c3bdde0', 6374450, 3, 'Episode 3', 'As the surgical teams discuss options, the air ambulance rushes to help a patient who has been diagnosed with a polytrauma\\u202f— the worst level of injury.', '2025-07-23', 48, 7.0, 2, '/36e0IEhwfUxpEYcqmZlblvWECHN.jpg', None, '32cb4f4b78e04005af81b317b823e282', '0c9d0b3f000b40a7973420c55c3bdde0', 6374451, 4, 'Episode 4', 'The operations unit dispatches an\\u202fambulance for a construction worker who sustained a laceration to his wrist after falling through a pane of glass.', '2025-07-23', 47, 7.0, 2, '/atVJStDX0LVTHqMygNGpPf9iRa2.jpg', None, '7d19ee6b5bf64efabe1a23ff53baf95e', '0c9d0b3f000b40a7973420c55c3bdde0', 6374452, 5, 'Episode 5', 'The family of an assault victim wrestles with how much the trauma has altered his personality after the critical care team wakes him from his coma.', '2025-07-23', 47, 7.0, 2, '/zcOpog9OU7Pz7MdvP2U8Fp9YIYY.jpg', None, '476418f215524eca9886c9cd64d1c90f', '0c9d0b3f000b40a7973420c55c3bdde0', 6374453, 6, 'Episode 6', 'A team of orthopedic surgeons prepares for high-risk pelvic surgery, where any margin of error could cause permanent nerve damage.', '2025-07-23', 47, 7.0, 2, '/6UMvaQew06yAFkYTsNHkk6OnIA.jpg', None)"}
