{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:06.442839+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 182.8s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('392239df1d9348c2b33fad8fa6e144a8', 'b6aaff15d16d43d9b1c715bbfb1bb18d', 2573607, 1, 'Courage in the Cockpit', 'This episode looks at how pilots managed to fly after system failures.\\n\\nTypes of aircraft: Flight 232: McDonnell Douglas DC-10-10; Flight 32: Airbus A380-800; Flight 85: Boeing 747-400.', '2020-09-03', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '22f6b65c2b8041b29772bd705a95eefa', 'b6aaff15d16d43d9b1c715bbfb1bb18d', 2573601, 2, 'Death from Above', 'This episode looks at aircraft crashing into populated areas.\\n\\nTypes of aircraft: The Galloping Ghost: North American P-51 Mustang; XC-VMC: Learjet 45; Flight 498: McDonnell Douglas DC-9-32; light aircraft: Piper PA-28-181 Archer.', '2020-09-10', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '554504f4c3b344c8b487cf32a92e99fe', 'b6aaff15d16d43d9b1c715bbfb1bb18d', 2573598, 3, 'Survivors', 'This episode looks at stories from survivors of accidents.\\n\\nTypes of aircraft: Flight 242: McDonnell Douglas DC-9-31; Flight 1404: Boeing 737-500; Flight 801: Boeing 747-300.', '2020-09-17', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '2e2732c9aa1e46daa078eb004f2626b1', 'b6aaff15d16d43d9b1c715bbfb1bb18d', 2573584, 4, 'Lapse in Security', 'This episode looks at how prohibited items got past airport security.\\n\\nTypes of aircraft: Flight 1771: British Aerospace 146; Flight 182: Boeing 747-200B; Flight 873: McDonnell Douglas MD-90-30.', '2020-09-24', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'a01f15cc8ec34335879ef82f3e20b467', 'b6aaff15d16d43d9b1c715bbfb1bb18d' ... 20 parameters truncated ... None, None, '46a37a6800cf4ae0af6f4ea158ad0a4b', 'b6aaff15d16d43d9b1c715bbfb1bb18d', 2573593, 7, 'Mountain Impact', 'This episode looks at accidents involving controlled flight into terrain.\\n\\nTypes of aircraft: Flight 311: Airbus A310-300; Flight 129: Boeing 767-200ER; Flight 148: Airbus A320-100.', '2020-10-15', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '0bd93d330bb4408a8079a484e01a561d', 'b6aaff15d16d43d9b1c715bbfb1bb18d', 2573619, 8, 'Take Off Tragedies', 'This episode looks at how missteps during takeoff cause accidents.\\n\\nTypes of aircraft: Flight 006: Boeing 747-400; Flight 255: McDonnell Douglas MD-82; Flight 5022: McDonnell Douglas MD-82.', '2020-10-22', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '95ea5c13bd204a568babaf6c7b46585d', 'b6aaff15d16d43d9b1c715bbfb1bb18d', 2573614, 9, 'Maintenance Mistakes', 'This episode looks at accidents caused by maintenance errors.\\n\\nTypes of aircraft: Flight 2574: Embraer EMB 120 Brasilia; Flight 17: Douglas DC-8-71F; Flight 394: Convair CV-580.', '2020-10-29', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'fc5ef8097dcf4d69b19cb3d9543ce6db', 'b6aaff15d16d43d9b1c715bbfb1bb18d', 2573569, 10, 'Instrument Confusion', 'This episode looks at accidents caused by instrument failure or confusion.\\n\\nTypes of aircraft: Flight 201: Boeing 737-200 Advanced; Flight 8509: Boeing 747-200F; Flight 821: Boeing 737-500.', '2020-11-05', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
