'Landings Gone Wrong', \"This episode looks at how pilots' improvisation cause aircraft to crash during approach.\", '2021-03-01', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'c5a2c0a0ad854bdc8ddd70ca7e123797', '134bd347ad6c44c8ba4575a3140d5ae4', 2642294, 9, 'Frozen Wings', 'This episode looks at accidents caused by icing.\\n\\nTypes of aircraft: Flight 90: Boeing 737-200; Flight 3272: Embraer EMB 120 Brasilia; Flight 5428: Saab 340A.', '2021-03-08', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '1ff4a1370ffa404394a6b1fdaa0de738', '134bd347ad6c44c8ba4575a3140d5ae4', 2642295, 10, 'Splash Down', 'This episode looks at aircraft ditching in the water.  Types of aircraft: Flight 421: Boeing 737-300; Flight 91: Sikorsky S-92A; Flight 1153: ATR 72-200.', '2021-03-15', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
