{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:09.310257+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "INSERT INTO episodes (id, season_id, tmdb_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, vote_average, vote_count, tmdb_still_path, local_still_path) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ? ... 155 characters truncated ... , ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?) RETURNING created_at, updated_at, id"}
{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:09.310354+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 185.7s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('51444d5dfb814e6ba6aeb027248ada0a', 'f695dc9d5a3a4beea6235f03e7fdcbce', 1988423, 1, 'Episode 1', \"Masturbation turns out to be Otis' secret talent, but can he master his unruly desires for Ola? A chlamydia outbreak distracts the student body.\", '2020-01-17', 51, 7.4, 95, '/zLUTt5SzgvvpYokTwL9nq2QEEZt.jpg', None, 'd17d6e2474d84fbbb800dbcfd0002145', 'f695dc9d5a3a4beea6235f03e7fdcbce', 1994667, 2, 'Episode 2', 'After Jean makes a cringey appearance at school, Otis tries his hand at pleasing Ola—and advising a hapless teacher. Fearless Maeve buckles.', '2020-01-17', 50, 7.2, 67, '/aoTUp1kKCUeaw8jAyu2ZJXJq4gD.jpg', None, 'fa0fbd1ce2b34ee8840c4b94624a626f', 'f695dc9d5a3a4beea6235f03e7fdcbce', 1994668, 3, 'Episode 3', 'On her way to surprise Maeve, Aimee gets a horrible shock on the bus. Rahim connects with Eric as a Milburn family dinner gets seriously awkward.', '2020-01-17', 49, 7.5, 69, '/oO3Rxb9662jv1NprN5VnrQFJH9z.jpg', None, '0a12fdbf15af45118a6514aaf766ce4b', 'f695dc9d5a3a4beea6235f03e7fdcbce', 1997014, 4, 'Episode 4', 'Ola wants to go all the way, but Otis is on edge. Jean and Maeve need their space. Jackson has performance worries, and star-crossed lovers reconnect.', '2020-01-17', 51, 7.2, 61, '/n0FmFaY5WkF87nV01y7dU1BZczD.jpg', None, '4aa1b43a4bac40f79bc9bf39f9e7bcc6', 'f695dc9d5a3a4beea6235f03e7fdcbce', 1997015, 5, 'Episode 5', 'Otis and Eric get away from romance and retreat to the woods with Remi. But parents aren’t perfect, as Maeve knows. Later, Ola follows her heart.', '2020-01-17', 53, 6.9, 62, '/9th5kDCTc5nYjz9aE5SI395XnRC.jpg', None, '55b3e17dafdc4ef28970f97c4a829173', 'f695dc9d5a3a4beea6235f03e7fdcbce', 1997016, 6, 'Episode 6', 'Bouncing back is the only option, so Otis throws a small gathering that turns rowdy, and Jackson deals with the healing. Who can handle the truth?', '2020-01-17', 54, 7.3, 64, '/fZbrT3LgfvehTMdNg0ti92OT7Wt.jpg', None, '4963034b4fff4fc3bd58f8e24a72c4bf', 'f695dc9d5a3a4beea6235f03e7fdcbce', 1997017, 7, 'Episode 7', 'Welcome to the morning after. \"Sex kid\" has made a huge mess—and just can\\'t stop barfing. Chaos comes to class, and in detention, the girls bond.', '2020-01-17', 50, 7.7, 63, '/2b0Qw7MLXCBW8558zHIVll5EUgN.jpg', None, '33eb113144e24cf4947e3c6a09a69ffb', 'f695dc9d5a3a4beea6235f03e7fdcbce', 1997018, 8, 'Episode 8', 'The talking cure may be failing Otis and Jean as they sort out their issues. A wary Maeve makes the finals. Sexy Shakespeare never goes out of style.', '2020-01-17', 59, 7.1, 65, '/5AvJbMdjERWUTv8AeXzLyssxTWs.jpg', None)"}
