{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:09.449881+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 185.8s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('d8440a295f1a4622a6a8bbf9c86907b7', '4ee10e8c7eb646bcbdc54e9b37ba509c', 3042769, 1, 'Episode 1', \"Moordale's friskiest come together again — in more ways than one. Otis sports a 'stache but hides a secret. Jean comes clean. A head teacher arrives.\", '2021-09-17', 54, 7.3, 67, '/dYvqyupHvIKIHHg9u4jut1rAVwx.jpg', None, '638551f500e94ae8a2e2ca4476f7d40e', '4ee10e8c7eb646bcbdc54e9b37ba509c', 3042829, 2, 'Episode 2', 'Makeovers take over when Ruby gives Otis a magnetic revamp and Hope tones the school down. Way down. Elsewhere, Eric and Adam look to level up.', '2021-09-17', 61, 7.0, 55, '/nTJ3Odh4J5geDIFgJSWrEzQjAcE.jpg', None, '6c867607ed684b12994d63208c0078fa', '4ee10e8c7eb646bcbdc54e9b37ba509c', 3042830, 3, 'Episode 3', 'Self-expression is out as uniforms sweep the student body. Aimee opens up about the assault while Jackson bonds with cool nonbinary student Cal.', '2021-09-17', 53, 6.8, 52, '/8KUoW618yVL13qkBc7ogFf6f2LP.jpg', None, '974e021162c3434ba085c8e550080efb', '4ee10e8c7eb646bcbdc54e9b37ba509c', 3099439, 4, 'Episode 4', 'In the cold light of day, can sex turn into intimacy, and vice versa? Ruby recoils from Otis. Maeve connects with Isaac. Abstinence roils Moordale.', '2021-09-17', 53, 6.9, 50, '/ywhZRiD8BgXoKM0kHgM89OitoLz.jpg', None, '7d4d1940014c41f5b4c0feace3a1d3fd', '4ee10e8c7eb646bcbdc54e9b37ba509c', 3099440, 5, 'Episode 5', 'Vivid history collides with real awkwardness in France as the poo hits a windshield and friends slam on the brakes. A spark reignites. Jean explodes.', '2021-09-17', 54, 7.5, 54, '/jehLpkTLWfnnyZyKSeVSgooUQf4.jpg', None, '168c7751c7854dd599d0f032e5e10a05', '4ee10e8c7eb646bcbdc54e9b37ba509c', 3099441, 6, 'Episode 6', 'The truth is out there: Maeve gets the news, Aimee reveals her vulva cupcakes and more, and Eric navigates Nigerian life. Hope goes to new extremes.', '2021-09-17', 59, 6.8, 50, '/oCIqUWkdNr0GQZ3BA3SgxHcqWH8.jpg', None, 'bf70ac58b73640d399798966fbf076d5', '4ee10e8c7eb646bcbdc54e9b37ba509c', 3099442, 7, 'Episode 7', 'Home is where the heat is. Jean contends with a hot mess and a cold shoulder. Maeve deals with a mum on the run. The \"sex school\" finally goes public.', '2021-09-17', 58, 6.9, 52, '/gsmHo06nkGvk39WY62XCNmj8iXz.jpg', None, 'c1654d7e1b8140bd9acf28b0083ea6eb', '4ee10e8c7eb646bcbdc54e9b37ba509c', 3099443, 8, 'Episode 8', \"As a new day dawns, Moordale's fate hangs in the balance. Aimee spills. Eric confesses. Otis haunts the hospital. Honesty matters now, more than ever.\", '2021-09-17', 60, 7.4, 57, '/gPUI3MGqdiaFuBjJ3YVBrF70bjD.jpg', None)"}
