{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:09.592736+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 186s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('83b6d812108d47d19c8455c681615f91', 'e150f1cf6dd541fda4dff75397382737', 4564754, 1, 'Episode 1', 'Maeve butts heads with a prickly professor. Oceans apart, will her connection with Otis sizzle or fizzle? An attempted nude leads to a hairy situation.', '2023-09-21', 55, 6.7, 74, '/lKw8GIfelnlBzKm5JuTvBumAORz.jpg', None, '8709ec11944a4aea99ca34d39b4e6b6e', 'e150f1cf6dd541fda4dff75397382737', 4564755, 2, 'Episode 2', 'When a popular couple is on the rocks, Otis eyes an opportunity. Eric finds community. Surprises in the bedroom leave Jackson questioning his sexuality.', '2023-09-21', 52, 5.8, 39, '/wTVVSQv89kDR1QppMX4IZ6wT22.jpg', None, 'e183c5ee51d14821b2227b3f3d026c87', 'e150f1cf6dd541fda4dff75397382737', 4564756, 3, 'Episode 3', \"A scathing review rattles Maeve's resolve. Adam and Michael bond over life as a bachelor. Ruby helps Otis with his campaign — and his loneliness.\", '2023-09-21', 56, 6.0, 38, '/vc7U94KVu9PwjznEiKWWM4CTEOr.jpg', None, 'c6daf8731c324b02b2fd8c43ec4b63c4', 'e150f1cf6dd541fda4dff75397382737', 4564757, 4, 'Episode 4', \"Tragedy brings a familiar face back to Moordale. Jean's saving grace is Otis' worst nightmare. Ruby does recon. Aisha asks out Cal — but there's a twist.\", '2023-09-21', 56, 6.4, 37, '/7SBroxsZzGiCnzi8oWxdqy2SRoz.jpg', None, '439f80c9d6da46f79c3af2e465bbe507', 'e150f1cf6dd541fda4dff75397382737', 4564758, 5, 'Episode 5', 'Jean struggles to find joy in motherhood. Between heated debates and a hot date with a grieving Maeve, can Otis perform? Jackson has an identity crisis.', '2023-09-21', 55, 5.7, 36, '/yKNwRANLvti8ucdO1OfQA6guM9f.jpg', None, '65ed1e2e2ff84970a455188427a8c2d5', 'e150f1cf6dd541fda4dff75397382737', 4564759, 6, 'Episode 6', \"Goodbyes are never easy, but this one's a mess. With emotions firing on all cylinders, Maeve finds the right words. Aimee gets inspired; Eric gets real.\", '2023-09-21', 66, 6.3, 37, '/iVXpPuNdGBxwm65QTosYZ0F1ZuE.jpg', None, '89442b69a98443c6b34651ac2b5fa4c9', 'e150f1cf6dd541fda4dff75397382737', 4564760, 7, 'Episode 7', 'Elevator inaction sparks collective action. A sisterly argument years in the making finally boils over. Maeve makes things right — and makes a choice.', '2023-09-21', 60, 5.7, 35, '/i7UsyXtcnpu9qngUrBR8AJf7bxF.jpg', None, '116683b9cd174198837c834f2495e44a', 'e150f1cf6dd541fda4dff75397382737', 4564761, 8, 'Episode 8', 'Cavendish rallies to search for Cal. As Eric finds his calling, Jackson discovers his roots. Much like love, truth takes many forms — and it will out.', '2023-09-21', 85, 6.2, 38, '/78R3Wsv9sGTFcvEbOwbIIYjTwPe.jpg', None)"}
