{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:13.448555+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 189.8s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('294ec120137844e3a35c9d86e48b2568', '293570b701254b74a760f290609160f0', 3070216, 1, 'Final Demand', 'A special edition of the programme giving an insight into the world of debt collection from the perspectives of people who owe money, their creditors ... (86 characters truncated) ... ed in the series earlier in the year, while two new cases reveal that life-changing debt can affect anyone - no matter how wealthy they appear to be.', '2014-04-08', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '5dbe43ae134744809c7c8fbd7a275e51', '293570b701254b74a760f290609160f0', 3070218, 2, 'Eviction Special', 'Documentary series. The repossession agents find themselves dealing with an unusual case in which a landlord is threatening to evict his own mother, and a family whose immigration status is unclear face being made homeless.', '2014-11-19', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '5ea23b62af9143a8ba13e762cbb85ab0', '293570b701254b74a760f290609160f0', 3070219, 3, 'Final Demand', 'One-off edition of the documentary giving an insight into the world of debt collection from the perspectives of people who owe money, their creditors ... (107 characters truncated) ... le Paul Bohill and his team deal with a difficult case involving a mother and daughter who are about to be left out on the street with nowhere to go.', '2015-04-14', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '6899d67b155748bfa739d2833e01d2b7', '293570b701254b74a760f290609160f0', 3070221, 4, 'Benefits Special', 'Paul and Steve attend the eviction of a family who owe more than £12,000 in rent arrears, but the situation turns confrontational when the landlord a ... (286 characters truncated) ... repayment, and later meet an aggressive debtor recovering from a brain tumor who refuses to pay his dues, despite owing more than £2,000 to a lawyer.', '2015-08-04', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '79463351543144bd8f9e86dfdd655517', '293570b701254b74a760f290609160f0', 3070222, 5, 'Christmas Special', 'Seasonal edition of the documentary giving an insight into the work of High Court enforcement bailiffs and repossession teams. The agents grapple wit ... (8 characters truncated) ... nal evictions and moral dilemmas as a young family is made homeless, an acrimonious divorce comes to a head, and an off-licence battles to stay open.', '2015-12-23', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
