er that she has nowhere to go.', '2014-10-08', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '1244fadb54934c3386d3605b4349a476', '2a1e4cc7dd7f42688d323ecc2b0f08b7' ... 20 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'ecd7c173d3894c4c8a2be22a67613921', '2a1e4cc7dd7f42688d323ecc2b0f08b7', 1114286, 7, 'Episode 7', \"Paul and Steve make an interesting discovery during an eviction at a flat in London's Docklands, where they find $8.5 million in counterfeit notes. L ... (305 characters truncated) ... ebt for seating, and later hunt for a debtor whose business is in the centre of a storage unit facility, but the manager refuses to allow them entry.\", '2014-10-29', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'a1550a4cfbb04bc0a82b45a49ef0c7c6', '2a1e4cc7dd7f42688d323ecc2b0f08b7', 1114287, 8, 'Episode 8', 'Paul and Ben are called in to evict squatters from a residential property, but it soon becomes clear that the property is being used as a brothel. La ... (425 characters truncated) ... oods. They later attend a Korean education school to collect unpaid rent, but the debtors make accusations to the police that they have been violent.', '2014-11-05', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'adf91ce588b542d9bdc37c73faf5564a', '2a1e4cc7dd7f42688d323ecc2b0f08b7', 1317914, 9, 'Episode 9', 'Brian and Graham head to a Brighton health spa to speak to seize assets against the debt of £20,000 for unpaid legal costs against the owner. On thei ... (231 characters truncated) ... shows his softer side; and to Dunsfold to reclaim money owed to a telephone answering service, but find the debtor about to visit his motherʼs grave.', '2014-11-12', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '9d31e94f6a674a7aa9f374b1288b745d', '2a1e4cc7dd7f42688d323ecc2b0f08b7', 1317915, 10, 'Episode 10', \"Paul and Steve attend an eviction with a twist when they discover that the landlord trying to reclaim the property is the debtor's mother. On their t ... (259 characters truncated) ...  the tenant to leave; and attend the eviction of the last remaining tenant in an apartment block which is c