{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:14.158765+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 190.5s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('6e3cdac20151458da7dbb3f998dfa35e', 'f9b2bb4b9ac5430290060b78423e5d0b', 1317929, 1, 'Episode 1', \"Agents Stewart and Iain head to Lancashire for an eviction that proves to be the most confrontational case they have ever faced. In Surrey, Brian and ... (85 characters truncated) ... rying to recover £12,000 of debt on credit cards. Meanwhile, Stewart and Iain's patience is tested to the limit during another eviction in Birmingham\", '2016-04-13', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'aca77b741c58472892a1f7fb9654cc9e', 'f9b2bb4b9ac5430290060b78423e5d0b', 1317930, 2, 'Episode 2', 'Agents Stewart and Elmore are met with lies and aggression when they track down nearly £3,000 owed by a garage mechanic, while Steve and Ben encounte ... (81 characters truncated) ... it a young debtor who owe £750 for a laptop computer, and in Oxfordshire, Paul and Steve chase £30,000 owed by a world-famous Formula One racing team', '2016-04-20', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '48b066560ee44a2ea7cc9a594c9075d7', 'f9b2bb4b9ac5430290060b78423e5d0b', 1317931, 3, 'Episode 3', 'Agents Stewart and Iain head to Manchester, where a landlord is owed £8,000 in rent arrears and has already called for police back-up. As tempers ris ... (162 characters truncated) ... gents, before tracking a debtor who was accidentally over-paid for a job. Plus, Stewart and Iain face an eviction that is set to test their patience.', '2016-04-27', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'a99cd05b71974f54a9fde4e87ab559a5', 'f9b2bb4b9ac5430290060b78423e5d0b', 1317932, 4, 'Episode 4', 'In West London, agents Steve and Ben face the most audacious sublet scam they have ever seen, where the tenant owes £14,000 in unpaid rent. Meanwhile ... (127 characters truncated) ... from a mother who is financially dependent on her new partner. Plus, in North London, Paul and Steve come face-to-face with a terrible case of mould.', '2016-05-04', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'be7952aca844415a83e7eaf3d0d215ba', 'f9b2bb4b9ac5430290060b78423e5d0b' ... 200 parameters truncated ... None, None, '1aaebcb0e36a4eda83414ecc80f4d1c6', 'f9b2bb4b9ac5430290060b78423e5d0b', 1317950, 22, \"Can't Pay's Best Bits, Part 1\", \"The first of four special episodes combining new and unforgettable past cases. Stewart and Vic attempt to reclaim £5,400 owed by a man that Vic has m ... (394 characters truncated) ... m money for a business venture. Del also looks back on a case featured in Series 3, Episode 1, where he and Kevin were assaulted by a violent debtor.\", '2016-11-16', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'd9f8d1e09c08410a855aaa0010116013', 'f9b2bb4b9ac5430290060b78423e5d0b', 1317951, 23, \"Can't Pay's Best Bits, Part 2\", \"The second of four special episodes combining new and unforgettable past cases. Stewart and Vic attend the eviction of a single mother who owes £6,00 ... (388 characters truncated) ... Stuart looks back at a case featured in Series 4, Episode 1, where they were threatened by the boyfriend of a single mother they were bound to evict.\", '2016-11-23', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '0ae32f1fab7f4e78b9f3037282c31231', 'f9b2bb4b9ac5430290060b78423e5d0b', 1317952, 24, \"Can't Pay's Best Bits, Part 3\", 'The third of four special episodes combining new and unforgettable past cases. Stewart and Vic head to a phone shop whose proprietor owes £3,900 to a ... (384 characters truncated) ... holiday. Steve looks back on a case from Series 4, Episode 7, where he and three other agents carried out a mass eviction of travelers in Birmingham.', '2016-11-30', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '8b1323ae62bb44c4805e6408a96ae11a', 'f9b2bb4b9ac5430290060b78423e5d0b', 2761184, 25, \"Can't Pay's Best Bits, Part 4\", 'Paul and Steve make a dangerous discovery leading to them calling the police. Elsewhere, Stewart and Vic face a moral dilemma, and Paul and Steve hear a story that stops them in their tracks. This episo