{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:15.159808+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 191.5s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('8a7f408c6a534b44ba94d9dd50272296', 'e32a3c5027ad4bf2b9629e118d9d0d14', 78892, 1, 'One Stayed Clean', \"On class picture day, the kids vow to keep Gus clean as he's never had a class picture of him taken.\", '1999-09-11', 11, 7.0, 1, '/mbwdPdbjErKFk8Vi2PB40dLl3HH.jpg', None, '253d27580e344809964d7b2aba7d11d2', 'e32a3c5027ad4bf2b9629e118d9d0d14', 78893, 2, 'A Genius Among Us', 'Someone else besides Gretchen is a math genius, and through math, Gretchen starts a close relationship with this person.', '1999-09-11', 11, 7.0, 1, '/omjk3iST2jFhwfWRin8poZvl7tb.jpg', None, 'a373b245a6e84c319cf1e557bdb39295', 'e32a3c5027ad4bf2b9629e118d9d0d14', 78894, 3, 'Dodgeball City', 'The main kids discover that Gus was once a notorious dodgeball player who went by the name of El Diablo.', '1999-09-18', 11, 0.0, 0, '/eQ8a4DvEnMobN19mN3Oni2FS3Mt.jpg', None, '175bcad9202a46c8be5154ef62f2e1dd', 'e32a3c5027ad4bf2b9629e118d9d0d14', 78898, 4, 'A Career to Remember', 'A career day assembly gets all the kids to decide their future careers.  That is all except Spinelli.', '1999-09-18', 11, 7.0, 1, '/taIw6kTOMDxTsZugOvNQDkGwgSG.jpg', None, '41c0f4540ee64aacbd3e50ff81255931', 'e32a3c5027ad4bf2b9629e118d9d0d14' ... 92 parameters truncated ... '/t1qvYnW9UDCBuKZodHTdqiKW7nF.jpg', None, '4052b8184574496c977c8c41c743f0d8', 'e32a3c5027ad4bf2b9629e118d9d0d14', 78908, 13, 'The Barnaby Boys', 'T.J. and Vince are so into the \"Barnaby Boys\" books that they dress up like the Barnaby Boys and try to solve the mystery of the suspicious substitute janitor, Earl Raymond.', '2000-01-15', 11, 0.0, 0, '/wDCBp3Klthmzy7QLqQtmbQvV8PJ.jpg', None, 'c1ff27e093344eba897e70f3bf663ba4', 'e32a3c5027ad4bf2b9629e118d9d0d14', 78910, 14, 'Buried Treasure', 'TJ receives an old history textbook with a treasure map that leads the gang, Randall, and the Ashleys out to get the treasure. But as they get closer, greed arises and the 4th graders fight for the treasure.', '2000-01-15', 11, 8.0, 1, '/c8fnJV3wT4yqjjyWbyPOWwFmTRj.jpg', None, 'a7864670d9ac40078fd66febf61af53f', 'e32a3c5027ad4bf2b9629e118d9d0d14', 78911, 15, 'The Library Kid', 'When the gang catches the mysterious \"\"Libray Kid\"\", they take her out to recess where she becomes obssessed with the playground.', '2000-01-22', 11, 0.0, 0, '/y1pdlNmIH8p8dnazMsCgOuLLtwh.jpg', None, '54448d7720ee401bb69cb90c015d4ee8', 'e32a3c5027ad4bf2b9629e118d9d0d14', 78913, 16, 'The Ratings Game', \"Everyone is segregrated once the Ashley's start giving ratings to everyone on the playground.\", '2000-01-22', 11, 7.0, 1, '/oQtCifs9l2wFdlqknaPyFmcica4.jpg', None)"}
