{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:16.414799+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 192.8s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('9466e912df2b4d40bacc8eccb7632b1f', '7ad2d361c19b41dc82d2ff968cd654dd', 1042371, 1, 'Our Rising Oceans', 'A report on climate change that features a visit to Antarctica to observe melting glaciers and a report on rising sea levels in Bangladesh. Then an interview with Vice President Joe Biden.', '2015-03-06', 30, 5.0, 1, '/eAxsSm4QoAfmDCgMyLRCTf84lcv.jpg', None, 'a878f89813664bad90b7469f33b6232a', '7ad2d361c19b41dc82d2ff968cd654dd', 1044446, 2, 'To Serve and Protect & Coming to America', '“To Serve and Protect” – Thomas Morton reports from Ferguson, Mo., in the aftermath of the fatal shooting of Michael Brown, and interviews journalist ... (116 characters truncated) ... Salvador to observe the reasons behind mass migration north, and chronicles a journey through Central America on top of trains that leads to the U.S.', '2015-03-13', 30, 8.0, 1, '/8zHH1ow9McvuL6qeWMRGZ2au0iS.jpg', None, '34c416ba538a474e93588dd803f44ddc', '7ad2d361c19b41dc82d2ff968cd654dd', 1045794, 3, 'We The People & Countdown to Extinction', \"“We the People” – A recent study funded by the Department of Homeland Security listed domestic right-wing groups as two of the top three greatest ter ... (200 characters truncated) ... s the Mozambique Channel and the Gulf of Mexico to get an idea of how much we've overfished our oceans, and what we can now do to reverse that trend.\", '2015-03-20', 30, 10.0, 1, '/skcQ0rz8yOBG232g5SYmluanjnn.jpg', None, 'faf09c84eab0473aa6600db2e9ece55d', '7ad2d361c19b41dc82d2ff968cd654dd', 1045795, 4, 'Lines in the Sand & Outsourcing Embryos', 'Drug trafficking in Africa. Indian women who are paid to carry babies for wealthy foreigners.', '2015-03-27', 30, 9.0, 1, '/6pp3pL7ZcGl2oEJG3o6IFoNuzLC.jpg', None, '0721946e527b46d5ae874f1dcf20d672', '7ad2d361c19b41dc82d2ff968cd654dd' ... 68 parameters truncated ... '/DIP7jufZKQWMFehwwBCTaqmoQZ.jpg', None, 'cd5d0314d21d43cbbb78dd5f083e04de', '7ad2d361c19b41dc82d2ff968cd654dd', 1058222, 11, 'Evolution of a Plague & Campus Coverup', 'An investigation of sexual assault on college campuses and why schools try to keep it off the record includes remarks by Sens. Kirsten Gillibrand (D-N.Y.) and Claire McCaskill (D-Mo.). Also: a report on the Ebola outbreak in Africa.', '2015-06-05', 30, 9.0, 2, '/simAP3RtVSFYu7eCrxkjE89xX31.jpg', None, '10c1e780a07448a1919d08898666d136', '7ad2d361c19b41dc82d2ff968cd654dd', 1058223, 12, 'Enemies at the Gates & Global Jihad', \"Suroosh Alvi travels to Saudi Arabia to see how America's staunchest Arab ally is defending itself - and how it may be fanning the flames of global m ... (37 characters truncated) ... urope to meet some of the young men drawn to ISIS's call, and visits with American Navy strike pilots working to roll back the Islamic State's gains.\", '2015-06-12', 30, 9.0, 1, '/4Xt49iA3biKOkXlDVwOBZtV2RNh.jpg', None, 'b89c1a803654406bb83812057243c8b4', '7ad2d361c19b41dc82d2ff968cd654dd', 1058224, 13, 'Afghanistan After Us & La Haine', \"Ben Anderson returns to Helmand, the country'smost violent province, to investigate the security situation in Afghanistan as American involvement winds down. Vikram Gandhi goes to Paris to gauge the causes of the growing hate in the City of Lights.\", '2015-06-19', 30, 10.0, 1, '/vPptucNkODanFmZki6IAbV7SPAU.jpg', None, '8c782e079f3c464986e496b529fdc0c0', '7ad2d361c19b41dc82d2ff968cd654dd', 1061107, 14, 'Cold War 2.0', 'The increasingly strained relationship between Russia and NATO is examined in the Season 3 finale, which includes remarks by U.S. president Barack Obama and vice president Joe Biden.', '2015-06-26', 30, 10.0, 1, '/pHECfNRlYba6NFj5IE7qmA3h3Vc.jpg', None)"}
