{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:17.450186+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 193.8s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('3e1fea714499452ba3def39f191b75be', '1996d71f68fa4569a6ab81e2b6a3479d', 1841370, 1, 'I Was Flying', \"When a malfunction occurs aboard the luxury space cruise ship Avenue 5, it's up to engineer Billie McEvoy to warn Capt. Ryan Clark, owner Herman Judd and his right-hand woman Iris Kimura that the incident may have a cataclysmic knock-on effect.\", '2020-01-19', 29, 7.0, 21, '/yCPoh9YWsv5fTP2xbvApAfESb2G.jpg', None, '6936dac51d284345998d95d5898e8cce', '1996d71f68fa4569a6ab81e2b6a3479d', 2042019, 2, \"And Then He's Gonna Shoot Off...\", \"Rav and her team meet with a NASA representative to plot a potential rescue mission. An engineer working in a hidden part of the ship has a surprisingly optimistic theory about the ship's future. Karen becomes a vocal advocate for passengers.\", '2020-01-26', 29, 7.2, 21, '/5v8kiKZw2poWdcBUs5TLhT5cfCO.jpg', None, 'eb619372fa3a49af852824ba764d9d44', '1996d71f68fa4569a6ab81e2b6a3479d', 2042020, 3, \"I'm a Hand Model\", 'Judd outlines the plan for a rescue mission and tasks Iris with organizing a vigil on Earth to raise the money to fund it. Rav endures a barrage of messages from the ship and handles an unruly press conference.', '2020-02-02', 27, 7.7, 20, '/rsGtu4yWz4ueOyawPxVrCz7mxfO.jpg', None, '94a3e661d13b4beca60758588a631704', '1996d71f68fa4569a6ab81e2b6a3479d', 2042021, 4, 'Wait a Minute, Then Who Was That on the Ladder?', 'With Judd worried about his reputation, Iris arranges a meet-and-greet with several passengers in his luxury suite. Frustrated by a bridge crew with no answers, Ryan and Billie bond with the engineers below deck.', '2020-02-09', 27, 7.6, 18, '/g3xOUXQNTmrqqkj54Up4g3TXiz9.jpg', None, 'a51c0fc261aa460e900f1f1ab04820c0', '1996d71f68fa4569a6ab81e2b6a3479d' ... 8 parameters truncated ... '/uK3VEAY6oWLwSjwA5Oh5HJXUXqo.jpg', None, '6b90927bcfbf4d58bc90f4481fddbe5e', '1996d71f68fa4569a6ab81e2b6a3479d', 2072530, 6, 'Was It Your Ears?', \"Rav attempts to secure funds for a rescue mission, while on the ship the stress begins to show when what appears to be an oxygen leak is detected. Meanwhile Judd hits on a plan to beautify the ship's recently gained orbital ring.\", '2020-02-23', 28, 7.2, 14, '/nQtQkA7MPMvc5I2yVMMLQZlpF7i.jpg', None, '8ecf9e0cfffd4ac39fc4efd132f72c95', '1996d71f68fa4569a6ab81e2b6a3479d', 2161511, 7, 'Are You a Spider, Matt?', \"Judd enlists Ryan to help charm Harrison Aimes, an uber-wealthy passenger who has a strange effect on Judd. Meanwhile, the passengers become transfixed by a divine image circling the ship and Rav deals with the fallout when the ship's moral quandary hits the media.\", '2020-03-01', 27, 7.6, 16, '/a7bVsAtvJyeqRZVDeXThAeBH0lW.jpg', None, '0f2399a2ebe644c8b19963a9c8668678', '1996d71f68fa4569a6ab81e2b6a3479d', 2176737, 8, 'This Is Physically Hurting Me', 'While Karen oversees an effort to jettison non-essential passenger items, Billie tries to teach an inattentive Ryan  how to dock the ship. Matt learns of Judd’s plan to make the “ultimate sacrifice” by returning to Earth. Meanwhile, the passengers suspect all is not as it seems with the journey.', '2020-03-08', 27, 7.9, 15, '/mzOUJXOXCSKbfLoBLuufljpomNt.jpg', None, 'd69dc5153e534a4a86a0633f906ba3cb', '1996d71f68fa4569a6ab81e2b6a3479d', 2176738, 9, 'Eight Arms But No Hands', 'A search party commences for Matt, who’s in hiding with a guilty conscience – and the airlock codes. Iris questions Karen about her rumored affair wi ... (3 characters truncated) ... Ryan. Rav seeks an apology from Judd for ruining her life, as chaos ensues when a seat on a rescue shuttle suddenly becomes available. Season finale.', '2020-03-15', 27, 7.9, 16, '/x0rBk3gG5fpGknHT7ZDilvEL3uz.jpg', None)"}
