{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:17.870182+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 194.2s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('a34cab6be83043b88351b2e6c7bd361a', '3e8f4d0dbf034326b4a9a2c99cf8481f', 972730, 1, 'Pilot', '97 years after a nuclear war, human kind is living in space. 100 juvenile delinquents are sent down to Earth to see if the planet is habitable.', '2014-03-19', 42, 6.706, 102, '/yMB0FqEUmp2rPUPcivJ1XhC005.jpg', None, 'edb55b0b4e1b48a4bac1c0a85c49c125', '3e8f4d0dbf034326b4a9a2c99cf8481f', 973085, 2, 'Earth Skills', 'Discovering that Jasper may still be alive, Clarke, Bellamy, Finn, Wells and Murphy head out to find him. On the Ark, Abby is determined to prove Earth is habitable, and enlists a mechanic to craft an escape pod.', '2014-03-26', 45, 6.595, 79, '/lWGRq2T9qy89OZidN1ZVByyDo5J.jpg', None, 'c38f716bfb634286945772a22a65c906', '3e8f4d0dbf034326b4a9a2c99cf8481f', 973318, 3, 'Earth Kills', \"As a dangerous, acidic fog approaches, Clarke, Finn and Wells set out in search of a seaweed-like plant to make an antibiotic poultice for Jasper's wounds, while a vulnerable young girl follows when Bellamy takes a group out hunting for food.\", '2014-04-02', 43, 7.081, 68, '/zWgS4g1mHsz5RWdduf2U1qLFsMe.jpg', None, 'd07aee17645f470989759b1216b0d116', '3e8f4d0dbf034326b4a9a2c99cf8481f', 973741, 4, \"Murphy's Law\", 'Bellamy, Clarke and Finn try to protect Charlotte when everyone learns she killed Wells. On the Ark, Abby risks getting floated in order to give Raven the chance to launch the escape pod.', '2014-04-09', 40, 7.3, 65, '/rItEXhC0srkFqSjT6kTwgYMQqFH.jpg', None, 'b0e36c6a81e346b293f4bd4b3ff0e8b5', '3e8f4d0dbf034326b4a9a2c99cf8481f' ... 56 parameters truncated ... '/oxB6THWezq1zxKcYevcwmxddvZG.jpg', None, '8c0f8e578be24f8592d9acd3b5680d50', '3e8f4d0dbf034326b4a9a2c99cf8481f', 991803, 10, 'I Am Become Death', 'Murphy returns to the camp carrying a horrific virus created by the Grounders to weaken the camp. After learning the Grounders plan to attack the next day, Bellamy, Finn and Raven come up with a plan to delay them.', '2014-05-21', 43, 7.298, 57, '/2mrZvSGG1gqF0C3gmEhZ8BJVPyR.jpg', None, '4e5aa34f50b4424daa3eff646b7a0510', '3e8f4d0dbf034326b4a9a2c99cf8481f', 991804, 11, 'The Calm', \"Clarke and Finn are captured by Anya, who forces them to save the life of a victim of the explosion. Meanwhile, Raven deals with her split from Finn, and Kane fights to save the Ark and it's survivors.\", '2014-05-28', 43, 7.241, 54, '/sI1Sr6oOleCrk4pwaa7zifOCo1.jpg', None, '6c38433da74d47fc9a8318bf9884429c', '3e8f4d0dbf034326b4a9a2c99cf8481f', 991805, 12, 'We Are Grounders (1)', 'Clarke and Finn come face to face with a new enemy after Lincoln rescues them from Anya, while Bellamy, Raven, Octavia and Jasper deal with a vengeful Murphy. On the Ark, Jaha makes a plan to try and get to Earth.', '2014-06-04', 43, 7.491, 56, '/u2TRn2R3D3cFhERtzeMcA8kfaFb.jpg', None, '88471af27dde4ef0880638f86505a7b5', '3e8f4d0dbf034326b4a9a2c99cf8481f', 991806, 13, 'We Are Grounders (2)', 'As the remaining members of the 100 face off against the Grounders, Jaha makes a noble sacrifice to ensure the Ark makes it to Earth.', '2014-06-11', 42, 7.677, 62, '/j9Bj0pjUgRLW6MW7j8CJPoGj2Wi.jpg', None)"}
