d465f1b75', 1038154, 14, 'Bodyguard of Lies', 'Lexa and Clarke get into a heated discussion during battle preparations; Bellamy races against time.', '2015-02-25', 43, 7.978, 46, '/v9nlzQaIC1VcRG6oWNdlg95DcJo.jpg', None, '64b0fc41040c493bbd7740dfff3fc123', 'ef4ef3adc7ce42c7b9c136bd465f1b75', 1038153, 15, 'Blood Must Have Blood (1)', 'Wick and Raven are faced with a setback. Maya and Jasper witness a terrible act.', '2015-03-04', 43, 8.023, 43, '/sHqZilPG5T0IYlnBDSPg8sWu5Z6.jpg', None, 'fb68a20e9c904a70b10c1839484c6872', 'ef4ef3adc7ce42c7b9c136bd465f1b75', 1038152, 16, 'Blood Must Have Blood (2)', 'Jaha makes a surprising move. Clarke gets help from an unexpected source. Lincoln seeks revenge.', '2015-03-11', 42, 8.48, 50, '/gpqDCcrRzN8CRGgi3aSO3idcszV.jpg', None)"}
