{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:18.177748+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 194.5s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('f6f3f8d09b48499fb40a80ad30d279c8', 'c85ce16a478b49c997c7c258073b41d0', 1146093, 1, 'Wanheda (1)', 'Three months have passed since the tragedy at Mount Weather and our heroes learn that a bounty has been put on Clarke’s head. Unbeknownst to Clarke,  ... (44 characters truncated) ...  into Grounder territory to save her. Meanwhile, Murphy finds his way to the mansion and discovers a very different Jaha on a very different mission.', '2016-01-21', 42, 6.509, 54, '/lvX5DPGYXGpJs0SHMkXIP4BzE6H.jpg', None, 'b50e43212abc4538b8d0a84d7eebb45e', 'c85ce16a478b49c997c7c258073b41d0', 1146094, 2, 'Wanheda (2)', 'Bellamy and Kane risk life and limb to rescue Clarke. In an attempt to avoid worrying about her daughter, Abby focuses on whether to open Mount Weather as a medical facility. Meanwhile, Murphy plots to betray his former Chancellor.', '2016-01-28', 42, 7.08, 44, '/pma3VaGLIwugRlRs2h9XyJKoEyQ.jpg', None, '2d44b58ee13b4fda9618fd6f6f7193ea', 'c85ce16a478b49c997c7c258073b41d0', 1158146, 3, 'Ye Who Enter Here', \"Clarke wrestles with a decision. Bellamy learns that something isn't what it seems. Meanwhile, Murphy plots to betray his former Chancellor.\", '2016-02-04', 42, 7.44, 42, '/vafq3iTJTraZGND0EOQxgPISlpq.jpg', None, '669d9fd7b8bc433fb0918c38e840e5b5', 'c85ce16a478b49c997c7c258073b41d0', 1158147, 4, 'Watch the Thrones', 'Clarke discovers the mastermind behind a devious plan. Kane struggles to keep the peace. Meanwhile, Jasper’s grief drives him to reckless behavior.', '2016-02-11', 42, 7.462, 39, '/1BQWumd9QB11QgfvinpcwuIk63D.jpg', None, '411ac521e3e54acda59c61be7f712459', 'c85ce16a478b49c997c7c258073b41d0' ... 92 parameters truncated ... '/ykN1FtGGhlIg3BfwOlQgJWo12RJ.jpg', None, 'cc79da562b1540d3979c972f1adbc429', 'c85ce16a478b49c997c7c258073b41d0', 1184336, 13, 'Join or Die', 'Clarke is on a mission that could change everything. Meanwhile, Murphy gains insight that might prove useful in ensuring his survival. Lastly, Kane reaches a breaking point.', '2016-04-28', 42, 7.434, 38, '/mu79Iw0oKXqaSCP2qfEbeptSm3a.jpg', None, 'de507580a68743db9b6fe48c6e5bbc02', 'c85ce16a478b49c997c7c258073b41d0', 1189895, 14, 'Red Sky at Morning', 'Clarke, Bellamy, Octavia and Jasper hit a tragic roadblock. Meanwhile, Raven and Monty make an important discovery.', '2016-05-05', 41, 7.5, 37, '/574S0jyVEi244LIbCDW1vA5O2w2.jpg', None, 'ec53ed83e6e94335b29b85d36413a0ec', 'c85ce16a478b49c997c7c258073b41d0', 1190494, 15, 'Perverse Instantiation (1)', 'Clarke finds hope in the most unlikely place. Meanwhile, Alie’s master plan comes together.', '2016-05-12', 41, 7.605, 38, '/nipAKX8l7bFgG1AohCs39QiF040.jpg', None, 'fd68028463e14d75ae00302438733ea5', 'c85ce16a478b49c997c7c258073b41d0', 1190495, 16, 'Perverse Instantiation (2)', 'Our heroes begin to face the reality of their tragic situation. Everyone prepares for a final showdown.', '2016-05-19', 42, 7.208, 36, '/bQ7ayEa7XthcwXA7pttPSKvuI3v.jpg', None)"}
