015-03-23', 48, 8.205, 156, '/5vpI6D2n4zma4xqQBRq2Bz3tHu5.jpg', None, '8e5f94ceae1b44e9afcf4b92e244f13d', 'f8b2e35700914e3183ade60c9c2e9c51', 1041928, 9, 'Pimento', \"Chuck urges Jimmy to accept a harsh truth. Meanwhile, a deal threatens to go off the rails when Mike's ability to complete a job is called into question.\", '2015-03-30', 48, 8.84, 163, '/iCMwMQstYZz8SRsiULMtiiP2xes.jpg', None, 'b6dd16b53be5456cae1da48010d4c1aa', 'f8b2e35700914e3183ade60c9c2e9c51', 1041929, 10, 'Marco', 'In the aftermath of recent events, Jimmy seizes an opportunity to reconnect with an old friend. Chuck adjusts to a new way of life.', '2015-04-06', 50, 8.279, 154, '/eUl8LoEhEtIy0kdyvwgo2ZNSH9B.jpg', None)"}
