{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:16:19.419168+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 195.8s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('b3d4dd6800554c0b9e5c3571b92ff041', '112215ca5a7b4b1682afe873029104b0', 1137066, 1, 'Switch', \"Jimmy and Kim's relationship takes a new turn. Mike decides it's for the best to sever his affiliation with an unrestrained associate.\", '2016-02-15', 47, 7.897, 141, '/bLx6Ow42rtFGJ0missJEfwUN4yF.jpg', None, '0439119ff3ea453e86d0be1db8a03b14', '112215ca5a7b4b1682afe873029104b0', 1164133, 2, 'Cobbler', 'To keep a potentially messy situation from unraveling, Mike brokers a deal. Jimmy works to exonerate an eccentric client.', '2016-02-22', 48, 8.1, 131, '/wRVKkfXsyhLAzpRC7J8Uek5dYg3.jpg', None, '9d32f2f0e9cd48bfa437a3dab21fed15', '112215ca5a7b4b1682afe873029104b0', 1164134, 3, 'Amarillo', \"Jimmy's client outreach efforts thrive, and he exhibits new heights of showmanship. Mike is perplexed by daughter-in-law Stacey's troubling news.\", '2016-02-29', 43, 8.004, 131, '/o3euy8qB8AErKQcVHRrGWV1Xtiq.jpg', None, '63b31687a6564ea287e2e8f7b162a83f', '112215ca5a7b4b1682afe873029104b0', 1171587, 4, 'Gloves Off', \"Jimmy's actions unexpectedly create waves for Kim. Mike cautiously weighs a lucrative proposal that might bring about dire consequences.\", '2016-03-07', 44, 8.402, 132, '/rtVuaHImiLxvnffNASJbF4Q3F89.jpg', None, '44d052b93f084f339748ab9912093061', '112215ca5a7b4b1682afe873029104b0' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/aUZtWB6MGftmrttpvfkc7GcGMtF.jpg', None, '842cef367b5243729b897125b851013f', '112215ca5a7b4b1682afe873029104b0', 1177127, 7, 'Inflatable', \"Mike's growing frustration shows when his hand is forced, but with Jimmy's help, he works to keep the peace. Meanwhile, Jimmy boldly forges a new path forward.\", '2016-03-28', 43, 8.128, 121, '/1RumrNbk6ZAGB5U1YqQR6h96u77.jpg', None, '0e9e8b56019f405089559405a3d7cc2f', '112215ca5a7b4b1682afe873029104b0', 1177128, 8, 'Fifi', 'Mike aims to settle the score with an enemy; an unexpected opportunity presents itself to Jimmy.', '2016-04-04', 49, 8.0, 120, '/43SruAr8U7y2qteRb9OaSTesQzy.jpg', None, 'a59fa606bc034582bb2158a005278c83', '112215ca5a7b4b1682afe873029104b0', 1177129, 9, 'Nailed', \"Mike takes a methodical approach to his mission. Someone questions Chuck's capabilities. Jimmy faces a personal dilemma.\", '2016-04-11', 50, 8.795, 129, '/7Q9JaQ63y3diwZ6HVebbMLfH9sc.jpg', None, 'd5bfea9059a045ba9ab2b1ec6effc6b9', '112215ca5a7b4b1682afe873029104b0', 1177130, 10, 'Klick', 'Jimmy must make a hard choice. Mike takes control of matters. Hamlin delivers shocking news.', '2016-04-18', 49, 8.579, 127, '/zit4sAsSYOnpk5MOcceRiQf0VTj.jpg', None)"}
