im pulls out all the stops for a case. Mike lets his team blow off steam. Nacho receives a visitor.', '2018-09-24', 53, 8.49, 101, '/prdfPctjYisErdRPE9MY5lhFaYt.jpg', None, '167fe58bca964eca9d9b5fb0f3161661', '9f6c3312dfbd49f685c0b8b26cfdaf43', 1562084, 9, 'Wiedersehen', 'Jimmy and Kim unburden themselves, risking their relationship in the process. Nacho is forced to make the rounds with Lalo. Mike has cause to worry.', '2018-10-01', 55, 8.875, 100, '/dsZZClwZHFqAUK6VjVIuPOwtxfS.jpg', None, '78c9497961e3411b9d60dfed07d375db', '9f6c3312dfbd49f685c0b8b26cfdaf43', 1562085, 10, 'Winner', \"Jimmy turns the page on his reputation. Lalo tracks a loose end in Gus' operation. Mike is forced to make a difficult decision.\", '2018-10-08', 61, 9.186, 105, '/3MGD5ySNFm3FktUh6eoZwMwkDkC.jpg', None)"}
